~ convo_1
Fenn: Hey Wizard man, do you like ice cream?
Wizard: Woooow. Asking thy 'ice guy' if he liketh ice cream. Very original.
Fenn: Well... you call me 'pint-size.' So... do you?
Wizard: Wha- NO!!
Wizard: Tis a mockery of nature. An insult to everything which is cold.
Fenn: Are you lactose intolerant?
Wizard: And there thou goes! Assuming I'm lactose intolerant just because I liketh not ice cream!
Fenn: Well, are you?
Wizard: Tis besides the point!
Fenn: Huh... no wonder all those ice creams are so mad.
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-Ws-Cellar-1", true)
do EventFlags.num_cellar_conversations += 1
=> END

