~ convo_3
Wizard: Hey, pint-size, you seem close with Az.
Fenn: Oh yeah! She's great.
Wizard: D-Does she, like... I dunno... 
Fenn: What?
Wizard: What doth she, like, think? Liketh regarding me?
Wizard: Doth she thinketh I'm cool?
Fenn: Yeah of course! Everyone thinks you're cool!
Wizard: Really?!
Az: NO! Fenn, stop making stuff up.
Fenn: But I wasn't...
Winston whispering: I forgoteth she was there...
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-Ws-Cellar-3", true)
do EventFlags.num_cellar_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_4
Fenn: Where'd you get your coat?
Wizard: Oh. Well, my Mother madeth it.
Fenn: That's really nice! You must have a really cool Mom.
Wizard: Yeah... wouldst be. If she even cared.
Fenn: What do you mean?
Wizard: Nothing. Worry not 'bout it.
