~ convo_7
Fenn: Hey Wizard Guy, what do you do for fun?
Wizard: Hmph. Why do thee careth?
Fenn: I dunno.
Wizard: Well, I readeth, I suppose.
Fenn: Read what?
Wizard: Uh... liketh, mysteries and detective stories.
Fenn: That's super cool! I like comic books. Do you read comics? I love Garbage Man, he's my favorite. Have you heard of Garbage Man? He defeats the bad guys with his overwhelming-
Wizard: Uhhhhh...
Az: Fenn! Stop bothering the squatter. He's busy being a freak, or whatever.
Wizard: HEY!
